WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:03.290
The town on the island of
Cyprus also looks like

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:06.470
Sludge City. And indeed,
the authorities here have

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:08.960
been taken to court over
failings in its waste

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:09.770
management.

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:12.920
The state of the Cyprus
sewage system leaves a

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:14.230
lot to be desired.

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:18.020
So maybe what we're
seeing in this image is a

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:19.850
catastrophic sewage
leak.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.610
Turkey permanently
quarantines the ghost

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:26.400
town to be used as a
kind of bargaining chip

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.890
in negotiations over the
island's future.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.910
It forces the residents
to rebuild their lives

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.700
elsewhere. They were
basically told that they

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:35.910
can.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:38.490
Never return on the
threat of being shot.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.030
Varosha becomes a time
capsule.

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:46.350
The place sits abandoned
like a movie set.

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:51.300
You might pass a shop
with fashions from 1974

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.580
car dealerships where
you can see automobiles

00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:56.310
still inside an airport
with aircraft still

00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:58.080
parked on the runway
from 1974.

